sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant O as Order Service
    participant C as Customer Service
    participant R as Restaurant Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant D as Delivery Service

    U->>G: POST /api/orders
    G->>O: Forward request with user headers

    O->>C: Validate customer and profile
    C-->>O: Customer details

    O->>R: Validate restaurant and menu items
    R-->>O: Menu items and pricing

    O->>O: Create order and persist
    O-->>G: 201 Created (order response)
    G-->>U: 201 Created

    O->>MQ: Publish OrderPlacedEvent
    MQ-->>D: Deliver OrderPlacedEvent
    D->>D: Create delivery and assign status
    D->>MQ: Publish DeliveryStatusUpdatedEvent
    MQ-->>O: Deliver DeliveryStatusUpdatedEvent
    O->>O: Update order delivery status
